  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EPA, working in partnership with USAID West Africa and Water and Sanitation for Africa (WSA) to build capacity on drinking water quality with respect to (1) the development of regulatory frameworks and enforcement approaches, (2) participation of the public in decision-making processes, and (3) building the capacity of laboratories for monitoring and surveillance of drinking water.</narrative>
